{
    "name": "E2E SAP Emarsys - Make API Call",
    "description": "End-to-end test for the SAP Emarsys connector - calls the Core API v3 /settings endpoint directly.",
    "notes": {
        "626fded7-938b-494c-a166-8bef52717b38": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 928,
            "height": 208,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Emarsys API credential setup\n\nEvery endpoint permission of an Emarsys API credential is **disabled by default**.\nThis flow calls `GET https://api.emarsys.net/api/v3/settings`, which needs the\n`customer.settings` permission (Emarsys > Management > Security Settings > API Credentials).\n\nThe endpoint is read-only and needs no test data - it returns the account settings of the\ncredential itself, wrapped in the usual `{ replyCode, replyText, data }` envelope."
        }
    },
